        <mxCell id="auth-legend" value="&lt;b&gt;JWT Auth Flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;1. User visits /login → gets HS256 JWT (24h TTL)&lt;br&gt;2. JWT passed as Bearer token in every request&lt;br&gt;3. Each service validates: aud, iss, exp, claims (tid, sub, roles, upn)&lt;br&gt;4. Token propagates: UI → Agent WS → MCP → Core API&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FCE4EC;strokeColor=#F48FB1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=5;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
