        <mxCell id="tech-legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Technology Stack&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;Language: Python 3.13 | Framework: FastAPI + Pydantic v2 | Agent: Strands (ReAct) | Tools: FastMCP&lt;br&gt;Graph DB: Neo4j 5.26.9 CE + APOC + GDS | Vector DB: Milvus | LLM: OpenAI GPT-4.1 / Anthropic Claude&lt;br&gt;Embeddings: sentence-transformers, model2vec | Infra: Docker, AWS ECS Fargate, Terraform, GitLab CI/CD&lt;br&gt;Auth: MS Entra ID (OAuth 2.0) → Eugene JWT (HS256) | UI: Streamlit | Eval: MLflow&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#90A4AE;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=5;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
